{"about_the_game":"The dark tide of the lost rises, and with it comes a chasm through the skies. The cosmic voice that eats up light. Leaving all but frail, wretched beings bereft of spirit who wander the lands in search of the spark, the ember of life. Beware the grey, indomitable fog.<br><br>How to play: Click cards above and below the foundation in value. Beyond that, it is for you to discover the mechanics of Dire.<br><br>Faerie Solitaire Dire will challenge your skill, your luck, and your sanity as you match cards up and down, destroy walls of ooze, play with light and shadow, meddle with curses, open gates, and linger with salt and bone. What sinister wonders await those brave enough to face the Dire.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/556530/extras/42a731e6dd1361011061acfd1a660275.webp?t=1727950890\" width=616 height=62 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"64bb6b671c08a3f5803670e9b76a936d80d834ac.jpg","localized_name":"Crystal Purification","name":"Crystal Purification","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/556530/64bb6b671c08a3f5803670e9b76a936d80d834ac.jpg"},{"icon":"9f15aa085841ea7c8ac17463fb1c7f397e8f52cf.jpg","localized_name":"Realm Purification","name":"Realm Purification","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/556530/9f15aa085841ea7c8ac17463fb1c7f397e8f52cf.jpg"},{"icon":"2fcc09763b454800d4e87453776ad7539a48b522.jpg","localized_name":"World Purification","name":"World Purification","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/556530/2fcc09763b454800d4e87453776ad7539a48b522.jpg"},{"icon":"7b58092265bfc4a9c924f4322548f833ad5d64a3.jpg","localized_name":"Golden Pocket","name":"Golden Pocket","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/556530/7b58092265bfc4a9c924f4322548f833ad5d64a3.jpg"},{"icon":"b44aced54628f1